OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPatchy rain, sleet and snow
OL,6,Finitially, soon clearing to leave a
OL,7,Fcold, bright morning with showers.
OL,8,FOutbreaks building into the afternoon
OL,9,Fwith some turning heavy also wintry to
OL,10,Flow levels. Northwest breezes strong
OL,11,Fover the Hebrides.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FNorth to northwest breezes
OL,14,Fpushing wintry showers across the
OL,15,Fregion, but few outbreaks reaching the
OL,16,Fsouthern end of the Great Glen. Frost
OL,17,Fforming in central and southern areas
OL,18,Ftowards dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
