OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCold. Spells of sunshine mixed
OL,6,Fwith, occasionally wintry, showers,
OL,7,Fthese most frequent from Inverness
OL,8,Fnorthwards and through the morning.
OL,9,FNortherly breezes turning to the
OL,10,Fsoutheast during the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FTuesday brings periods of rain and
OL,14,Fhill snow to the south. Wednesday
OL,15,Frather cloudy with some patchy
OL,16,Frain.Thursday frosty, dry and bright
OL,17,Fin south, with showers in north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
